.el .ds Aq '
.TH maw-new 1  "maw-new " 
.SH NAME
maw\-new \- create modules/<name>.nix, importing any live config, then edit it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmaw new\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-activate\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
create modules/<name>.nix, importing any live config, then edit it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
css, ini, json, kdl, keyValue, raw, shell, or toml; defaults to the registry\*(Aqs
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-activate\fR
only create and edit; activate later
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
the program, as the registry names it
.SH EXTRA
see: maw help writing a module
